{
	chapter.682F77009283396D.title: "Chapter 1: Prehistory"
	quest.0433F83473C1CF8C.quest_subtitle: "All and all"
	quest.0F51EFE74AEBE66A.quest_desc: ["In this pack, punching trees does NOT give you wood! You must knap your own tools from stone and give them wood stick handles. Do not even bother making a crafting table yet. Most stone age recipes require only the 2x2 anyways so don't worry. Remember, use JEI! Look for a flat place to found your first village."]
	quest.0F51EFE74AEBE66A.quest_subtitle: "In the Beginning...."
	quest.0F51EFE74AEBE66A.title: "Staring out...."
	quest.1020804B34117078.quest_desc: ["Once you have procured a stone knife, you can begin cutting the brush and grass for plant fibers! Right click on the grass to cut some live fibers, left click on it to cut some dry fibers. Both have their uses. READ JEI!!"]
	quest.1020804B34117078.quest_subtitle: "The last...."
	quest.102F6E287B312719.quest_desc: ["Frames can be placed down and then shift right click with some lumber to board them up, this uses less wood than crafting them in a crafting table."]
	quest.102F6E287B312719.title: "Timber Framing"
	quest.1434B88D24B91F7C.quest_desc: ["Woodwork is hard work. You need to debark and then use a copper saw on the block in the world to saw it and cut it into shape. You can build various blocks for construction."]
	quest.1434B88D24B91F7C.quest_subtitle: "Sharpen the saw...."
	quest.188D09310245F1B5.quest_desc: ["To make smooth stone, you need to use a pit kiln for it."]
	quest.19FBB428FC4B1ED4.title: "Third Village"
	quest.1D51872E7EDB1FBB.quest_desc: ["Thatch needs to dry before you can sleep on it. Place the green plant fibers down and wait. You cannot make a house out of dirt or cobble stone without support. Many more blocks in the game have physics now!"]
	quest.1FD57AF7EAF5969B.quest_desc: ["The spindle can be used to slowly craft plant fibers into vanilla string. Very useful."]
	quest.1FD57AF7EAF5969B.quest_subtitle: "You spin me right around...."
	quest.260F6CB36B961F93.quest_desc: ["To open the Planet Altas and see planetary info, press the period \".\" key. To open the creature bestiary, press the colon \";\" key. This is a beautiful planet...... try not to ruin it."]
	quest.260F6CB36B961F93.quest_subtitle: "determination...."
	quest.260F6CB36B961F93.title: "Geno Side"
	quest.2A9E6AB57188027D.quest_desc: ["You can craft Millenaire thatch at a crafting table from TFC thatch."]
	quest.2F894DD3455FC7DB.quest_desc: ["Charcoal is made like a pit kiln. You dig a hole and place wood by shift right clicking the hole then light it and QUICKLY place gravel over on top of the flame, then wait."]
	quest.304B49B8B08C4F0B.quest_desc: ["You will need canvas to craft many basic items. A drying rack is needed to dry the plant fiber fabric."]
	quest.304B49B8B08C4F0B.quest_subtitle: "Stich in time"
	quest.32CFD33A3939F7F7.quest_desc: ["The basket is good early storage once you acquire good cordage. They do not protect foods however from spoilage."]
	quest.3465E3407DC827D5.quest_desc: ["You do not have to have a bucket to in order to start farming. Just hoe the land and plant the seeds and wait....."]
	quest.37805EA3FDCD434E.quest_desc: ["Food Bundles are a special resource. It is made of one food item from each food group. (except dairy) You and villagers can craft food bundles to feed and increase the population of the settlement. They are needed for quest rewards and research later. They keep food fresh!"]
	quest.3E845DEB76466538.quest_desc: ["Vanilla torches are harder to craft now however they stay lit indefinately."]
	quest.4273A09ACD552886.quest_desc: ["Congratulations on completing the first few quests! You may now found another new settlement! Submit the materials and look for a FLAT SPACE to put the meeting hall hut."]
	quest.4273A09ACD552886.quest_subtitle: "Where the heart is..."
	quest.4273A09ACD552886.title: "Found your second survival camp"
	quest.42B602328067BAEF.quest_desc: ["Frames can be placed down and then shift right click with some lumber to board them up, this uses less wood than crafting them in a crafting table."]
	quest.42B602328067BAEF.title: "Crafting Table"
	quest.45D3F59FFB3F1DD9.title: "Copper Mine Charter"
	quest.4B4A4F9B151B9330.quest_subtitle: "It is not for hanging on the wall!"
	quest.4D24CAB30F2DE53E.quest_desc: ["Animals have skins, bones, meat, and organs you can use for crafting a variety of stuff. Hunt an animal."]
	quest.4D24CAB30F2DE53E.quest_subtitle: "Chase two rabbits...."
	quest.4DB2379C62D52428.quest_desc: ["Leather water flasks are a good way to store drinking water early. You can craft them with leather and an organ randomly dropped from animals."]
	quest.4DB2379C62D52428.quest_subtitle: "Bring me wine...."
	quest.4DB2379C62D52428.title: "Time in a bot- er flask."
	quest.51F6BC36418C5E25.title: "Fortress Charter"
	quest.5711190390E55513.quest_desc: ["You can create a firepit by pressing Q to drop two logs, three sticks and optionally up to three straw then shift hold right click with a firestarter kit to ignite it."]
	quest.5711190390E55513.quest_subtitle: "Moths to a flame..."
	quest.606382EE5076E7DE.quest_desc: ["Back in the stone age before tannin, people would use the brains of the animal to tan the hide. This process is crude and primitive but it will get you leather early on."]
	quest.606382EE5076E7DE.quest_subtitle: "Braaaiins"
	quest.606382EE5076E7DE.title: "Primitive Tanning"
	quest.643DC1EE431B3CBA.quest_desc: ["There are all sorts of plants to eat. harvest one. Remember, if you are stuck or want to know more about what to use something for or how to make it, Press U or R on the item in the inventory respectively."]
	quest.643DC1EE431B3CBA.quest_subtitle: "A time of sowing...."
	quest.6DC37D9F62F817B8.quest_desc: ["Glue can be obtained in the stone age by boiling and melting hides in water in a pot."]
	quest.6DC37D9F62F817B8.quest_subtitle: "Couldn't put it down....."
	quest.751FAA8295010A00.quest_desc: ["Clay can be used in a pit kiln to make ceramic goods. The small clay vessel will be needed to melt copper later."]
	quest.751FAA8295010A00.quest_subtitle: "Vessel unto honor...."
	quest.796725D955488B18.quest_subtitle: "Makes them ring....."
	quest.7EEF0B2971C22D80.quest_desc: ["Welcome to CivCraft governor! In this modpack, you will embark on a journey through the ages of Civilization building up towns with resource gathering semi autonomy! Follow these quests to get started and remember: Press \"R\" on an item to see what you need to make it. Press \"U\" on an item to see what you CAN MAKE with it."]
	quest.7EEF0B2971C22D80.quest_subtitle: "Test of Time"
	quest.7EEF0B2971C22D80.title: "Welcome to CivCraft!"
	quest.7FD5B7E29422B13A.quest_desc: ["Clay can be found almost anywhere, but you need to find a rich deposit of it when just starting out. Any dirt block can hold clay and you can see it on the side. Clay is useful for all sort of appilcations."]
	quest.7FD5B7E29422B13A.quest_subtitle: "Molded for the kiln"
	task.393CA63969D7D081.title: "Yes"
	task.439F4AB00E7DAA9B.title: "Gatherer"
	task.5B946614E6E8078B.title: "Hunting"
}
